@startuml
title RF19 — Reforçar o elenco: free agency, trocas e waivers · Máquina de estados: FreeAgentOffer.status
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFF7EE
skinparam StateBorderColor #DC5B26
state "PENDING" as PENDING
PENDING : oferta válida no teto
PENDING : concorre com ofertas da IA
state "ACCEPTED" as ACCEPTED
ACCEPTED : contrato assinado
ACCEPTED : rosterStatus ACTIVE · ledger do teto
state "REJECTED" as REJECTED
REJECTED : jogador recusou
REJECTED : ou assinou com outra franquia
state "WITHDRAWN" as WITHDRAWN
WITHDRAWN : manager retirou a oferta
state "EXPIRED" as EXPIRED
EXPIRED : expiresAt vencido (Scheduler)
[*] --> PENDING
PENDING --> ACCEPTED : jogador aceita
PENDING --> REJECTED : recusa / outra oferta vence
PENDING --> WITHDRAWN : retirar
PENDING --> EXPIRED : prazo
ACCEPTED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
WITHDRAWN --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
@enduml
